Usage of doctor:
  -dry-run
    	report what --repair would do, without writing
  -moved-from string
    	with --repair, name this checkout's own previous path explicitly (loto-in0v) rather than relying on on-disk auto-detection
  -orphan-mode
    	scan for orphan-mode files and report them
  -repair
    	reclaim stale locks
  -restore-orphan-mode
    	with --repair, also restore writable mode on orphan-mode files (implies --orphan-mode)
